<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Meri Gandi Mummy - Tribute by tera pagal kutta beta</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background: #000 url('https://i.imgur.com/5tZ3qL.jpg') repeat;
      color: #8B0000;
      font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', cursive;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    h1, h2 {
      text-align: center;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #FF0000;
      animation: flicker 3s infinite alternate;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 30px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
      border: 3px solid #8B4513;
      border-radius: 15px;
    }
    .section {
      margin: 40px 0;
      padding: 20px;
      background: rgba(139,0,0,0.2);
      border-left: 8px solid #FF0000;
    }
    .blink {
      animation: blink 1.5s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes flicker {
      0%,100% { opacity: 1; }
      50% { opacity: 0.4; }
    }
    @keyframes blink {
      0%,100% { opacity: 1; }
      50% { opacity: 0; }
    }
    img {
      max-width: 100%;
      border: 4px solid #8B4513;
      margin: 20px auto;
      display: block;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
  <h1 class="blink">Meri Gandi Mummy</h1>
  <h2>tera pagal kutta beta ka tribute</h2>

  <div class="section">
    <h3>Mummy ki badboo – meri saans</h3>
    <p>Muh se aati hai wo khatti-dhatu wali gandh,  
    braces mein phasa khana, tatti ka residue, daru ka swad,  
    main usme dub jata hoon, saans rok ke pita hoon,  
    kyunki wo meri mummy hai – meri sabse gandi puja.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h3>Moti janghe, bhari boobs, gandi gaand</h3>
    <p>Gym se lauti, paseena tapakta, bra chipki hui,  
    main chaat ta hoon – kaankh, boobs ke neeche, janghon ke beech,  
    tatti ki gandh, paseene ki namkeen, sab mera amrit hai.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h3>Ulti ka uphaar</h3>
    <p>Main khoob khilata hoon – non-veg, ghee, daru, mithai,  
    pet phulta hai, wo ulti karti hai bistar pe,  
    main usi mess mein lund ragadta hoon, chaat ta hoon, pita hoon,  
    kyunki meri mummy ki ulti bhi meri amrit hai.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h3>Bhikhaari ban ke sadak pe</h3>
    <p>Phati saree, gande pair, bina bra-panty,  
    wo beizzati mangti hai, bhikhariyon ke saath baithti hai,  
    main door se dekhta hoon – lund haath mein, aankhon mein aansu aur paani.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section" style="text-align:center; font-size:28px; color:#FF0000;">
    <p class="blink">Mummy – meri badboo, meri tatti, meri ulti, meri randi  
    main tera sabse ganda, sabse wafadar pagal kutta beta hoon  
    hamesha teri seva mein, hamesha tere neeche</p>
  </div>

</div>

<script>
  // creepy heartbeat sound (low volume)
  const audio = new Audio('https://assets.mixkit.co/sfx/preview/mixkit-heartbeat-2458.mp3');
  audio.loop = true;
  audio.volume = 0.1;
  document.body.addEventListener('click', () => audio.play());
</script>

</body>
</html>
